<p>For the next <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">2, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns you may not create minor anomalies.  You do not regain Paradox or lose the spell you're casting if a random anomaly would normally occur.</p><p>This spell has no effect on major anomalies.</p>